; One-line labyrinth - ONE continuous CLOSED loop, no pen lifts.
; Generated from a random spanning tree of a 16x16 grid, then traced around
; its outline. Because a tree has no loops, its outline is a single curve -
; so the whole maze is drawn without the pen ever leaving the paper.
;
;   >>> Place the pen near the BOTTOM edge, LEFT side of your paper. <<<
;   From the pen it draws mostly RIGHT (0 mm left, 150 mm right)
;   and mostly UP, away from you (0 mm down, 150 mm up).
;   It ends exactly where it starts.
;
G21
G90
G94
G91
